  "fullDescription": "Add a festive and elegant touch to your holiday décor with this 3D Printable Christmas Gift Box Candle Holder STL File. Inspired by a beautifully wrapped Christmas gift box, this charming candle holder combines a decorative present-inspired design with a practical candle holder form, making it a unique addition to Christmas and winter displays.\n\nThe gift box-inspired shape creates an eye-catching decorative piece for tables, shelves, mantels, countertops, dining areas, and holiday displays. Its festive appearance makes it perfect for creating cozy seasonal arrangements during Christmas parties, family gatherings, and holiday celebrations.\n\nThe STL Color File is designed for creating an attractive colorful 3D printed model using different filament colors. Experiment with festive color combinations and finishes to create a personalized candle holder that complements your Christmas décor.\n\nPerfect For\n\n• Christmas and winter décor\n• Candle displays and holders\n• Christmas table centerpieces\n• Holiday parties and family gatherings\n• Mantels, shelves, and countertops\n• Festive home displays\n• Gift box and Christmas-themed collections\n• Seasonal decorating projects\n• Dining table decorations\n• Creative 3D printing projects\n• Christmas décor collections\n• Unique holiday gift ideas\n\nUse this Christmas Gift Box Candle Holder as a Christmas candle holder, festive centerpiece, tabletop decoration, holiday display piece, or seasonal home décor accessory. Its gift box-inspired design adds a playful and festive character to any Christmas setup.\n\nPlease Note: This is a digital STL Color File. No physical product will be shipped. Please make sure your 3D printing setup supports STL files before printing.",
